/22H2 安装 KB5050021。如无法打补丁，可在防火墙中限制 TAPI 服务（tapisrv.dll）的网络入站访问，并禁用不必要的电话服务（Telephony Service）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21243","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2025/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21243","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21243.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21243"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0701","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21242","title":"Microsoft Windows Kerberos 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows Kerberos 存在信息泄露漏洞，攻击者需在特定网络条件下对 Kerberos 认证服务进行精心构造的查询，利用认证协议实现中的缺陷获取目标系统的敏感信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（AC:H），但无需身份认证（PR:N）及用户交互（UI:N），远程网络触发（AV:N），影响机密性（C:H）。成功利用可能导致凭据或会话密钥等敏感数据泄露，进一步扩大攻击面。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21242"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:52Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows 10 22H2/21H2 安装 KB5049981（OS Build 19045.5371/19044.5371），Windows Server 2019 安装 KB5050008（OS Build 17763.6775），Windows 11 对应更新 KB5050021。可通过\"设置→Windows 更新→检查更新\"自动获取。如无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙层面限制对 Kerberos 服务（TCP/UDP 88 端口）的访问，仅允许受信任网段连接，并启用 Kerberos 事件日志审计以监测异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21242","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2025/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21242","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21242.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21242.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0700","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21241","title":"Microsoft Windows Telephony Service 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service）中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，该服务在处理特定远程过程调用（RPC）请求时未正确验证输入数据长度，导致堆内存越界写入。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。攻击需要用户交互（如诱导用户点击恶意链接），但无需身份认证。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 系列。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21241"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:52Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049984)，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。受影响系统包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 各版本。如无法立即打补丁，可通过禁用电话服务 (TapiSrv) 作为临时缓解措施：以管理员身份运行 `sc stop TapiSrv` 和 `sc config TapiSrv start= disabled`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2025/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21241.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21241","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21241.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0699","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0699.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21240","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Service（电话服务）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 TAPI 请求触发该漏洞。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意服务器或执行特定操作（用户交互），成功利用后可实现远程代码执行，获取系统完全控制权（机密性、完整性、可用性均受高影响）。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21240"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:52Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049984，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，建议限制对 TAPI（电话 API）服务的网络访问，并在防火墙层面阻止不必要的 RPC 流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21240","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21240.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e