5 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户安装更新 KB5049984 等对应补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21236"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:51Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049984)。受影响 Windows 版本对应的更新包括 KB5049983、KB5050004、KB5050021、KB5049981，请通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或终端上禁用 TAPI 服务 (Telephony Service) 作为临时缓解措施，但需评估业务影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21236","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2025/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21236","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21236.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21236"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0695.t